      "text": "day of the Lord of hosts shall be upon every one that is proud, Isa. 2:12 (2 Ne. 12:12). in that day there shall be a root of Jesse, Isa. 11:10 (2 Ne. 21:10). day of the Lord is at hand, Isa. 13:6 (Joel 1:15; Zeph. 1:7; 2 Ne. 23:6; D&C 128:24). day of the Lord’s vengeance, Isa. 34:8. that day is great, Jer. 30:7. this is the day of the Lord, Jer. 46:10. day of the Lord is near, Ezek. 30:3. day of the Lord cometh, Joel 2:1 (Zech. 14:1). day of the Lord is great and very terrible, Joel 2:11. before the great and the terrible day of the Lord, Joel 2:31. day of the Lord is darkness, Amos 5:18. who may abide the day of his coming, Mal. 3:2. day cometh, that shall burn as an oven, Mal. 4:1 (JS—H 1:37).",
